WEBVTT

00:00:29.003 --> 00:00:30.547
Na drugoj strani sveta,

00:00:30.547 --> 00:00:32.215
Antarktik je kontinent,

00:00:32.215 --> 00:00:34.755
ceo okružen okeanom.

00:00:34.755 --> 00:00:37.730
Arktik ima polarne medvede,
ali nema pingvine,

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:40.713
a Antarktik ima pingvine,
ali nema polarne medvede.

00:00:41.357 --> 00:00:43.551
Hajde prvo da pričamo o Arktiku.

00:00:43.551 --> 00:00:45.956
Arktička oblast se sastoji
od ogromnog okeana

00:00:45.956 --> 00:00:47.881
prekrivenog ledom

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:49.627
i okruženom permafrostom bez drveća.

00:00:49.627 --> 00:00:51.194
Ova oblast može da se definiše

00:00:51.194 --> 00:00:53.129
kao oblast između arktičkog kruga

00:00:53.129 --> 00:00:54.516
i Severnog pola.

00:00:54.516 --> 00:00:56.215
Ako biste stajali na Severnom polu,

00:00:56.215 --> 00:00:58.836
u svim pravcima gde biste pogledali

00:00:58.836 --> 00:00:59.960
bio bi jug.

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:01.323
Ali teško je stajati dugo